msgid ""
"Automatically initialized by the hardware when a workgroup is launched as "
"part of a workgroup cluster. The *expected count* of this barrier is set to "
"the number of workgroups in the workgroup cluster."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUExecutionSynchronization.md:389
